:history

    0.2.2 - 2026/06/02 (1946141) [cli-upstream-main]
        :brief Restore the default startup path to the original interactive CLI while keeping Rich output.
        - fix(cli): restore original startup flow by default
        :src
            - Changed the chaoxing console script so no-arg startup calls the legacy CLI runner with Rich output instead of opening the TUI.
            - Changed main.py default_tui to false and made init_config load config files only when -c/--config is explicitly supplied.
            - Kept chaoxing tui as an explicit backup entry while preserving RichStudyDisplay for CLI runs.
        :doc
            - Updated README.md to describe default Rich CLI startup and optional backup TUI.
            - Updated api/README.md to mark the Textual TUI as a backup module.
        :test
            - Added tests that default chaoxing dispatches to legacy CLI and no-config init_config does not create ~/.chaoxing/config.ini.
            - Verified 15 unit tests, compileall, and CLI help smoke commands.

    0.2.1 - 2026/06/02 (a750414) [cli-upstream-main]
        :brief Fix the TUI interaction model around login, course selection, configuration, and logout.
        - fix(tui): make login and course selection the primary flow
        :src
            - Replaced the tab-first TUI with a login-first main screen for account input, login/refresh, course selection, start run, logout, and config access.
            - Moved speed/jobs/not-open behavior, tiku/API tokens, answer submission, and notification fields into a separate F2/config panel.
            - Added logout state clearing and default Cookie deletion action.
        :doc
            - Documented the new TUI flow and shortcuts in README.md.
            - Updated api/README.md to describe the login-first TUI and independent configuration panel.
        :test
            - Added Textual run_test coverage for selected course persistence, config panel toggling, and logout state clearing.
            - Verified 13 unit tests, compileall, and CLI help smoke commands.

    0.2.0.1 - 2026/06/02 (1575471) [cli-upstream-main]
        :brief Synchronize existing API module documentation with the uv/Rich/Textual workflow.
        - docs(api): sync module map for tui workflow
        :doc
            - Updated api/README.md to include config_store, events, rich_ui, and tui modules.
            - Clarified revised responsibilities for config, cookies, logger, process, base, and answer modules.
        :test
            - Scanned README.md, api/README.md, and resource/README.md for startup/config/module references.
            - Checked the staged docs diff with git diff --cached --check.

    0.2.0 - 2026/06/02 (743f2b8) [cli-upstream-main]
        :brief Modernize the CLI fork with uv, Rich progress, Textual TUI, and synchronized config.ini handling.
        - feat(tui): add Textual account/config/course/run workflow
        - feat(progress): replace noisy tqdm-style output with Rich event progress
        - feat(config): synchronize TUI and CLI settings through user-home config.ini
        - build(uv): manage runtime and CI dependencies with uv
        :src
            - Added config_store, events, rich_ui, tui, and chaoxing console entrypoint modules.
            - Routed study execution through run_study with event sinks while preserving legacy CLI behavior.
            - Moved cookies and logs under the app home directory with CHAOXING_HOME override.
        :config
            - Default config is generated from config_template.ini into ~/.chaoxing/config.ini.
            - Password is only written when remember_password=true; otherwise save_config_to_file clears it.
        :test
            - Added unit tests for config persistence, fallback paths, course filtering, Rich progress completion, CLI/TUI imports, and Textual config save flow.
            - Verified uv lock, unittest discovery, compileall, and CLI help commands.
